{
  "source": "../api/http.md",
  "modules": [
    {
      "textRaw": "HTTP",
      "name": "http",
      "desc": "<p><code>http</code> 模块用于构建和发送 HTTP 请求, 并把 OkHttp 响应包装为脚本侧对象.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>源码依据: <code>runtime/api/augment/http/Http.kt</code>, <code>RequestBuilder.kt</code>, <code>RequestBuilderHelper.kt</code>, <code>ResponseBodyNativeObject.kt</code>, <code>HttpSaveResult.kt</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "`6.7.0` 能力速查",
          "name": "`6.7.0`_能力速查",
          "desc": "<p>AutoJs6 <code>6.7.0</code> 的 HTTP 模块覆盖同步请求、回调请求和异步请求三类用法.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同步/回调: <code>request</code>, <code>get</code>, <code>head</code>, <code>post</code>, <code>postJson</code>, <code>postMultipart</code>, <code>put</code>, <code>delete</code>, <code>del</code>.</li>\n<li>异步: <code>requestAsync</code>, <code>getAsync</code>, <code>headAsync</code>, <code>postAsync</code>, <code>postJsonAsync</code>, <code>postMultipartAsync</code>, <code>putAsync</code>, <code>deleteAsync</code>, <code>delAsync</code>.</li>\n<li>构建: <code>buildRequest</code>.</li>\n<li>响应体: <code>response.body.string()</code>, <code>bytes()</code>, <code>json()</code>, <code>stream()</code>, <code>saveToFile()</code>, <code>close()</code>.</li>\n<li>请求选项: <code>headers</code>, <code>method</code>, <code>contentType</code>, <code>body</code>, <code>files</code>, <code>timeout</code>, <code>maxRetries</code>, <code>cacheBody</code>, <code>bodyCacheThresholdBytes</code>, <code>client</code>, <code>insecure</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>注意: 便捷方法不会自动把第二个参数函数识别为 callback. 如果需要 callback 且没有 options, 请显式传 <code>{}</code> / <code>null</code> 占位, 如 <code>http.get(url, {}, callback)</code> 或 <code>http.post(url, data, {}, callback)</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">http</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "`6.7.0` 能力速查"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] buildRequest",
          "name": "[m]_buildrequest",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "buildRequest(url, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "buildRequest",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>url</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 请求 URL; 没有 <code>http://</code> / <code>https://</code> 前缀时自动补 <code>http://</code></li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"httpRequestBuilderOptionsType\">HttpRequestBuilderOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://square.github.io/okhttp/5.x/okhttp/okhttp3/-request/\">okhttp3.Request</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>只构建 OkHttp <code>Request</code>, 不发送网络请求. <code>options</code> 非空时必须是 JavaScript 对象. 直接使用此方法时必须提供 <code>options.method</code>; 源码没有为裸 <code>buildRequest</code> 默认设置 <code>GET</code>, 缺少 method 会在构建请求时失败. 便捷方法会自动写入请求方法.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let req = http.buildRequest(&#39;https://example.com/api&#39;, {\n    method: &#39;GET&#39;,\n    headers: { Accept: &#39;application/json&#39; },\n});\nconsole.log(req.url().toString());\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "url"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] buildRequest"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] request",
          "name": "[m]_request",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "request(url, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "request",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>url</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"httpRequestBuilderOptionsType\">HttpRequestBuilderOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"httpResponseType\">HttpResponse</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同步发送请求并返回响应. <code>options</code> 会规范化为对象, 再构建请求和 OkHttp call. 直接使用 <code>request</code> 时必须提供 <code>options.method</code>; 源码没有默认 <code>GET</code>. 普通 GET 请求应优先使用 <a href=\"#m-get\">get</a>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let res = http.request(&#39;https://example.com&#39;, { method: &#39;GET&#39; });\nconsole.log(res.statusCode);\nconsole.log(res.body.string());\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "url"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "request(url, options, callback)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "request",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**callback** { [function](dataTypes#function) } - 回调参数为 `(response, error)` ",
                      "name": "**callback**",
                      "type": " [function](dataTypes#function) ",
                      "desc": "回调参数为 `(response, error)`"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { [void](dataTypes#void) } ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " [void](dataTypes#void) "
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "callback"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "url"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "callback"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>回调模式使用 OkHttp <code>enqueue</code>. 成功时调用 <code>callback(response, null)</code>, 失败时调用 <code>callback(null, error)</code>.</p>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] request"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] requestAsync",
          "name": "[m]_requestasync",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "requestAsync(url, options?, callback?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "requestAsync",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>url</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"httpRequestBuilderOptionsType\">HttpRequestBuilderOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>[ callback ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#function\">function</a> } - 回调参数为 <code>(response, error)</code></li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">object</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在后台线程执行网络请求, 并返回 AutoJs6 运行时的异步操作对象. 如果提供 callback, 会在 UI 线程包装响应后调用.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">http.getAsync(&#39;https://example.com&#39;, { cacheBody: true }, function (res, err) {\n    if (err) {\n        console.error(err);\n        return;\n    }\n    console.log(res.statusCode);\n    console.log(res.body.string());\n});\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
